    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Working days and the weekend",
     "texto": [
      "From Monday to Friday are the **dias úteis**: **segunda-feira, terça-feira, quarta-feira, quinta-feira, sexta-feira**. In everyday speech «-feira» is often left out: *segunda, terça, quarta...*",
      "The weekend is **o fim de semana**: **sábado** and **domingo**.",
      "When talking about regular days, **ao** or **à** is used: *ao sábado* (on Saturdays), *ao domingo* (on Sundays), *à segunda-feira* (on Mondays)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
